## Page Actions

This page can expose GUI actions to the Desktop agent through `VibenPage.actions.register()`:

```js
VibenPage.actions.register("status", {
  refresh: {
    description: "Refresh page data",
    execute: async (payload, context) => {
      return { content: [{ type: "text", text: "refreshed" }] };
    }
  }
});
```
